  "lastName": "Silvera",
  "overview": "Dr. Geoffrey Silvera is an advocate and distinguished scholar specializing in Health Care Management, with expertise in Strategic Management, Patient Experience, and Diversity Management. Driven by a commitment to advancing healthcare, Dr. Silvera focuses on empowering organizations to build sustainable solutions to enhance patient experience, care quality, and promote health equity outcomes.\nHe presently serves as an Associate Professor of Health Services Administration in the Department of Health Services Administration at The University of Alabama-Birmingham’s School of Health Professions. Previously, served on the faculty at Auburn University. He holds a doctorate in Health Policy and Administration from the Pennsylvania State University and masters and bachelors degrees from the University of Florida.\n\nIn addition to his academic position, he serves on the editorial boards QMHC and as the Associate Editor of PXJ.",
